{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17432","headline":"锡杖歌送明楚上人归佛川 · 权德舆","name":"锡杖歌送明楚上人归佛川","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上人远自西天竺，头陁行徧国朝寺。\n口翻贝叶古字经，手持金策声泠泠。\n护法护身唯振锡，石濑云溪深寂寂。\n乍来松径风更寒，遥映霜天月成魄。\n後夜空山禅诵时，寥寥挂在枯树枝。\n真法常传心不住，东西南北随缘路。\n佛川此去何时回，应真莫便游天台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17432.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17432","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}